nd wheezes bilaterally, regular rate, equal expansion; \n**Cardiovascular:**\n- S1 S2 irregular RR, no murmurs/gallops\n- 3+ peripheral edema, CR \\<3 sec in all extremities \n**Abdomen:**\n- Soft, non tender\n- Normoactive bowel sounds x 4 quadrants\n**Musculoskeletal:**\n- No joint swelling or erythema\n**Neurological:**\n- No focal deficits\n### **Laboratory & Imaging Results**\n- **CBC, BMP:** pending \n- **Chest X-Ray: **Pending\n### **Plan**\n1. **Admit to Medical for CHF**"
